 approves **11,92,200 fresh convertible warrants at Rs 210 to Mukul Mahavir Agrawal**, aggregating **Rs 25.04 crore** on a preferential basis; proposed, and subject to shareholder approval.","**Minolta Finance** — approves allotment of 40,00,00,000 fully paid-up rights equity shares of Re 1 at Rs 1.20 each, **worth approximately Rs 48.00 crore** (our arithmetic) — new allotment.","**Shanti Gold International** — board outcome recording the allotment of **46,43,471 fully paid-up equity shares** of Rs 10 face value (new allotment).","**Genesys International** — allotment of **2,50,74,226 securities** pursuant to its rights issue (new allotment).","**Swojas Foods** — conversion of securities recorded at **Rs 1.98 crore** (past conversion, not new capital)."],"fund_raises_fresh_equity":["**Aptus Pharma** — board approves a proposed **Rs 44.88 crore preferential issue** of equity shares, subject to members' approval on 14 September, earmarking Rs 25 crore for a manufacturing plant, Rs 10 crore for working capital and Rs 9.88 crore for general corporate purposes."],"m_and_a":["**Nitco** — signs a non-binding **MOU worth Rs 1,300-1,500 crore** with HOABL Impactum Land to jointly develop its Thal and Lonare land at Alibaug over five years, with definitive agreements pending and only a Rs 9 crore security deposit received _(~56.1% of mcap)_.","**Prozone Realty** — completes the **Rs 1,242.50 crore sale** of its mall subsidiaries (Kruti, Alliance and Empire) to Inorbit Malls, unchanged from the April 2026 announcement _(~195.2% of mcap)_.","**Mitshi India** — Karronn Naresh Bajaj opens an offer to acquire up to 22,88,000 shares (26% of voting capital) at Rs 15 a share, **worth approximately Rs 3.43 crore** (our arithmetic).","**Pavna Industries** — board approves acquiring a 52.38% stake in Pavna Electric Systems (Rs 25.78 crore turnover, a related-party transaction) while divesting its entire stakes in Pavna Auto Engineering and Swapnil Switches, both ceasing to be subsidiaries; no consideration disclosed.","**Almondz Global Securities** — board approves a Scheme of Arrangement to demerge its Infrastructure Advisory business (Rs 2.92 crore turnover, 4.58% of FY26 standalone revenue) into Almondz Global Infra-Consultant, subject to NCLT approval.","**Richfield Financial Services** — Finance Committee approves acquiring a loan portfolio of up to **Rs 7.00 crore** from KLM Axiva Finvest in one or more tranches, at arm's length.","**Indian Hotels / Oriental Hotels** — a Scheme of Arrangement between Oriental Hotels and The Indian Hotels Company is filed with the exchanges by both parties.","**KP Group** — KPI Green Energy, K.P. Energy and KP Green Engineering each file a **non-binding Letter of Intent with Raz Holding Group** for a proposed strategic investment or collaboration.","**Dabur India** — the NCLT New Delhi Bench reserves its order on the second motion petition.","**Tata Consultancy Services** — announces a partnership with **Porsche AG** on AI-powered mobility.","**LEAP India** — incorporates a new step-down subsidiary, LEAP Pallet Pooling Trading L.L.C.","**Gujarat Inject Kerala** — announces that it has entered into a Strategic Business Partnership Agreement."],"order_wins":["**Ratnamani Metals & Tubes** — its subsidiary Ratnamani Finow Spooling Solutions receives **export orders of USD 286 million (about Rs 2,700 crore on the filing's own conversion)** for spools and hangers, over 2-3 years, partly sub-contracted _(~16.4% of mcap)_.","**Ceigall India** — receives a **Rs 704.70 crore Letter of Acceptance** from MoRTH for the Lada-Sarli section of NH-913 in Arunachal Pradesh, in a 74:26 JV with Sushee Infra & Mining _(~12.9% of mcap)_.","**Insolation Energy** — its subsidiary Insolation Green Energy wins MSEDCL letters of award for **99 MW AC (128.7 MW DC) of solar** across nine sites, expected to earn **Rs 59.72 crore a year for 25 years** _(~Rs 425 crore to build, ~20.6% of mcap)_.","**Viviana Power Tech** — confirmed as **L1 bidder for a Rs 275.05 crore** MGVCL network-conversion project across three Gujarat divisions, pending the formal Letter of Intent _(~39.2% of mcap)_.","**GPT Infraprojects** — its subsidiary Alcon Builders is declared **L1 (lowest bidder) for a Rs 97.31 crore** Northeast Frontier Railway electronic-interlocking contract, pending formal award _(~6.8% of mcap)_.","**Brahmaputra Infrastructure** — signs a **Rs 70.18 crore** five-year performance-based maintenance agreement with MoRT&H for 87.18 km of NH-502A in Mizoram _(~14.7% of mcap)_.","**Krystal Integrated Services** — receives a **Rs 17.25 crore, five-year manpower-services work order** from The Maharashtra Rajya Sahakari Sangh, Pune _(~1.9% of mcap)_.","**Gabion Technologies India** — discloses purchase orders received between 9 and 22 August aggregating **Rs 5.24 crore** including taxes, for gabion boxes and slope-protection works, from customers it cannot name under NDAs _(~5.3% of mcap; SME)_.","**Expo Engineering and Projects** — receives a **Rs 4.98 crore** tankage-safety work order from Bharat Petroleum for the Haldia coastal installation, over eight months _(~2.6% of mcap; SME)_.","**Fischer Medical Ventures** — announces that the Catanduanes Integrated Digital Healthcare Project has been awarded to Time Medical Philippines (value not stated in the feed).","**Shelter Pharma** — reports the completion of an export order and the commencement of dispatch (value not stated in the feed)."],"other_notable":["**TCC Concept** — fixes **4 September 2026** as the record date for its split/subdivision.","**Vivo Bio Tech** — reports the **expiry of the convertible warrants allotted on 24 February 2025**; that capital does not arrive."]},"unlocks":[{"company":"Uday Jewellery Industries Limited","date":"2026-08-24","days":0,"detail":"Preferential allotment listed","instrument_id":"14721","mcap":473.2,"pct":1.21,"pct_of":"equity","shares":450000,"src":"BSE","symbol":"UDAYJEW","type":"PREFERENTIAL","url":"https://www.